# Launch-only constrained authenticated browser evidence. Gold uses the existing
# read-only release-probe credential to sign each /app/search document navigation
# with a fresh nonce, binds each document response to its serving release/replica,
# and cross-checks /version. Inject the secret only over the protected runner's
# stdin; it is never serialized or inherited by the app import, worker,
# Playwright driver, or browser process. The expected canonical runtime-manifest
# digest and Chromium path/digest are independently controller-attested launch
# policy, not values learned from /version, document headers, or the observed
# performance receipt. The bootstrap URL remains a local/developer compatibility
# input and cannot qualify flagship Gold.
